"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">The <span style=\" font-"
"style:italic;\">Match</span> option performs some post-processing:</p>\n"
"<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-"
"right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\"><li style=\"\" style=\" margin-top:12px; "
"margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; "
"text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">None</span>: Don't "
"perform any post-processing and return the means (note this might result in "
"colors not present in the original image)</li>\n"
"<li style=\"\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; "
"margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Closest</span>: Find the color in the original image that is "
"the closest to the mean</li>\n"
"<li style=\"\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; "
"margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Most Frequent</span>: Find the color in the cluster that "
"appears most often in the source image</li></ul></body></html>"
msgstr "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Noto Sans'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">k-Znači dijeli boje u klastere i pročišćava dodjelu na svakom iteracija.</p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Ovo je najbolja opcija pri praćenju slika s mnogo boja ili sjenčanje.</p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Za slike s mnogo boja povećanje broja ponavljanja će dati bolje rezultate, ali može biti sporije.</p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Opcija <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Match</span> izvodi neke naknadna obrada:</p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\"><li style=\"\" style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">None</span>: Nemojte vršiti nikakvu naknadnu obradu i vratiti sredstva (imajte na umu da to može rezultirati bojama koje nisu prisutne u izvorniku slika)</li>\n<li style=\"\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Closest</span>: Pronađite boju na originalnoj slici koja je najbliža srednjoj </li>\n<li style=\"\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Most Često</span>: Pronađite boju u skupini koja se najčešće pojavljuje u izvornoj slici</li></ul></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (plainText), widget (QPlainTextEdit, plainTextEdit)
#: src/gui/widgets/dialogs/color_quantization_dialog.ui:159
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"k-Modes gives you the colors that appear most often in the source image.\n"
"\n"
"It's very fast but it does not give accurate colors for complex images.\n"
"\n"
"This is the best option when tracing images with flat colors."
msgstr "k-Modes vam daje boje koje se najčešće pojavljuju na izvornoj slici. \n\nVrlo je brz, ali ne daje točne boje za složene slike. \n\nOvo je najbolja opcija pri praćenju slika s ravnim bojama."

#. i18n: ectx: property (html), widget (QTextEdit, textEdit_2)
#: src/gui/widgets/dialogs/color_quantization_dialog.ui:178
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/"
"REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n"
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Noto Sans'; font-size:10pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">The Octree algorithm "
"merges similar colors from the bottom up.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">It gives more accurate "
"colors for complex images but it might result into colors that are not "
"present in the source image.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Noto Sans'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Algoritam Octree spaja slične boje odozdo prema gore. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Daje preciznije boje za složene slike, ali može rezultirati bojama koje nisu prisutne na izvornoj slici.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_4)
#: src/gui/widgets/dialogs/color_quantization_dialog.ui:189
#, kde-format
msgid "Min Frequency"
msgstr "Min. frekvencija"

#. i18n: ectx: property (html), widget (QTextEdit, textEdit_3)
#: src/gui/widgets/dialogs/color_quantization_dialog.ui:205
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/"
"REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n"
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Noto Sans'; font-size:10pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Edge Exclusion Modes takes "
"the most frequent color (mode) in the image, then excludes all pixels "
"touching said area, then repeats the process until the appropriate number of "
"colors has been found.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">This approach removes anti-"
"aliased edges but it might cause small details to not be detected.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Min Frequency</span> refers to the minimum amount of pixels "
"that a color must have to be considered (as a percentage of the total number "
"of pixels in the image).</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Noto Sans'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Edge Exclusion Modes uzima najčešću boju (mod) na slici, zatim isključuje sve piksele koji dodiruju navedeno područje, zatim ponavlja postupak dok se ne pronađe odgovarajući broj boja pronađeno.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Ovaj pristup uklanja anti-aliased rubove, ali može uzrokovati da sitni detalji ne budu otkriveni.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Min Frekvencija</span> odnosi se na minimalnu količinu piksela koje boja mora uzeti u obzir (kao postotak ukupnog broja piksela na slici).</p></body></html>"

